{"id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-1hbf","title":"[review] project-LICHEN-worker6-1ror: transcript_4 missing CRED_R per RFC 9528 method 0","description":"The code implements EDHOC method 0 (SIGN_SIGN), per line 578 comment and `METHOD = 0` at line 709. Per RFC 9528 §4.1, for method 0:

```
